<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.61 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.61 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.61 percent in the week ending November 16 from 6.47 percent the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Nov 16, 1996  Nov 9, 1996  Nov 18, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.61	  +6.47	   +8.32</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.4	  319.1	   299.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended Nov 18, 1995.</p>
</text>
